12
00:00:48,795 --> 00:00:54,767
Genomes as data — A genome is the full DNA information set of an organism or sample.

13
00:00:54,767 --> 00:01:00,526
PCR and amplification — PCR amplifies chosen DNA regions so they can be analyzed.

14
00:01:00,526 --> 00:01:06,427
Gel electrophoresis and comparison — Gel electrophoresis separates DNA fragments by

15
00:01:06,427 --> 00:01:07,627
size.

16
00:01:07,627 --> 00:01:13,314
Genetic engineering tools — Biotechnology tools can copy, edit, compare, or move

17
00:01:13,314 --> 00:01:14,736
